OL,3,GNEWSAAdoption has been life changing,
OL,4,Asays single dad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man said adopting a child had been a
OL,7,F"life-changing" experience as charities
OL,8,Fwarned of a growing shortage of
OL,9,Fadoptive families.
OL,11,FShamser, a single father from Ipswich,
OL,12,Fwelcomed Kusum, nine, about two and a
OL,13,Fhalf years ago, which he said had been
OL,14,Fa joy.
OL,16,FStatistics from Adoption England and
OL,17,Fthe charity Coram show children in
OL,18,FSuffolk spend 748 days on average
OL,19,Fwaiting to be adopted, compared to the
OL,20,Fnational average of 646.
