OL,3,GNEWSAAdoption has been life changing,
OL,4,Asays single dad
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Johal, the national strategic
OL,7,Flead for Adoption England, said the
OL,8,Flack of families coming forward to
OL,9,Fadopt had contributed to the waiting
OL,10,Fperiods, as a new campaign aimed to
OL,11,Fbridge the gap.
